<title>USA: Robomatix 1996 revenues off 45 pct.</title>
<headline>Robomatix 1996 revenues off 45 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Robomatix Technologies reported Monday that 1996 revenues fell 45 percent, although its operating losses narrowed.</p>
<p>The Tel Aviv company said in a statement that the sale of its robotic products division and the lack of sales from a new product line were behind the decline.</p>
<p>It said its operating loss for the 1996 calendar year was $4.5 million compared to $5.0 million in 1995, down 11 percent. It blamed a drop in its gross profit on lower revenues from U.S. sales, due to the sale of the assets of Robomatix Inc.</p>
</text>
